          "attack-pattern--c3d4bdd9-2cfe-4a80-9d0c-07a29ecdce8f"
        ],
        [
          "description",
          "Using harvested domain credentials and captured session tokens, the attacker authenticates to corporate VPN or Microsoft 365/Azure AD as a legitimate domain user, bypassing MFA. This provides initial network access without deploying any malware."
