        ],
        [
          "description",
          "Using the KRBTGT hash obtained via DCSync, the attacker forges a Golden Ticket Kerberos TGT for any domain account with arbitrary group memberships, granting persistent, nearly-unrevocable Domain Admin access. This completes the Active Directory takeover objective."
