          "technique_id": "T1558.001",
          "tactic": "Credential Access",
          "description": "Using the KRBTGT hash obtained via DCSync, the attacker forges a Golden Ticket Kerberos TGT for any domain account with arbitrary group memberships, granting persistent, nearly-unrevocable Domain Admin access. This completes the Active Directory takeover objective.",
          "depends_on": [
